ahUKEwityvefu8ONAxVYxzgGHbFmFycQo_EKegQICxAB\" style=\"margin: 20px 0px 10px; letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 26px;\"><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665412\">Key Responsibilities:</span></div></div></div><div class=\"WaaZC\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 29, 53); font-family: \"Google Sans\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div class=\"RJPOee EIJn2\" style=\"animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none !important;\"><ul jscontroller=\"M2ABbc\" jsaction=\"jZtoLb:SaHfyb\" data-hveid=\"CB0QAQ\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwityvefu8ONAxVYxzgGHbFmFycQm_YKegQIHRAB\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 24px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px;\"><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style: inherit;\"><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665379\"><strong>Developing and maintaining web applications:</strong> </span><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665368\">This includes writing code, designing APIs, and ensuring the application runs smoothly.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style: inherit;\"><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665346\"><strong>Working with databases:</strong> </span><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665335\">Laravel developers are skilled in using relational databases (like MySQL or PostgreSQL) and managing data efficiently.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style: inherit;\"><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665313\"><strong>Understanding and implementing security best practices:</strong> </span><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665302\">Ensuring the application is secure against vulnerabilities and threats.</span></li><li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 4px; list-style: inherit;\"><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665280\"><strong>Optimizing performance:</strong> </span><span data-huuid=\"8247855173564665269\">Making sure the application runs efficiently and responds quickly.</span></li><li style=\